                <td class="px-4 py-3">Faster (more localized stress)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p><strong>Fleece vs. cellulose:</strong> Fleece pouches are softer and conform better to gum contours, reducing friction. Cellulose is more durable but can feel slightly rougher. For sensitive gums, fleece is preferable.</p>

        <h2>8 Best Nicotine Pouches for Sensitive Gums</h2>

        <h3>1. Helwit Blueberry Medium</h3>
        <p><strong>Strength:</strong> 6–8mg | <strong>Format:</strong> Regular | <strong>Material:</strong> Fleece</p>
        <p>Helwit is known for gentle, low-pH formulations. Their blueberry variant uses soft fleece and moderate nicotine, making it ideal for gum-sensitive users. The fruity flavour masks any chemical notes, and the slow release minimizes irritation spikes.</p>

        <h3>2. Zyn Gentle Mint Mini S1</h3>
        <p><strong>Strength:</strong> 3mg | <strong>Format:</strong> Mini | <strong>Material:</strong> Ultra-thin cellulose</p>
        <p>Zyn's mini line and lowest-strength (S1) versions are specifically designed for comfort. The ultra-thin pouch sits almost invisibly, and 3mg is low enough to minimize gum stress while still providing subtle nicotine presence.</p>

        <h3>3. ON! Mint</h3>
        <p><strong>Strength:</strong> 8mg | <strong>Format:</strong> Slim | <strong>Material:</strong> Fleece</p>
        <p>ON! uses a proprietary gentle pouch design with pH-balanced nicotine. The slim format reduces gum contact area, and the menthol flavour provides a cooling sensation that many users find soothing rather than irritating.</p>

        <h3>4. Nordic Spirit Spearmint</h3>
        <p><strong>Strength:</strong> 7–9mg | <strong>Format:</strong> Slim | <strong>Material:</strong> Fleece</p>
        <p>Nordic Spirit products are engineered for comfort, with lower alkalinity and softer pouches. Spearmint is a fresh, clean flavour that doesn't leave a harsh aftertaste, and users report minimal irritation even with extended wear.</p>

        <h3>5. Skruf Fresh Mint S4</h3>
        <p><strong>Strength:</strong> 4mg | <strong>Format:</strong> Slim | <strong>Material:</strong> Fleece</p>
        <p>Swedish-made Skruf prioritizes gum health. Their S4 (lowest strength) in slim format is one of the mildest options on the market. The fresh mint flavour is crisp without being numbing, and the gentle nicotine delivery causes virtually no irritation.</p>

        <h3>6. Velo Ice Cool Mini</h3>
        <p><strong>Strength:</strong> 4mg | <strong>Format:</strong> Mini | <strong>Material:</strong> Ultra-thin fleece</p>
        <p>Velo's mini line features ultra-thin, super-soft fleece. The ice cool flavour provides a soothing sensation, and the low nicotine content means gentle absorption. Many sensitive users prefer Velo's texture to other brands.</p>

        <h3>7. LOOP Mint Mania Mini</h3>
        <p><strong>Strength:</strong> 5–6mg | <strong>Format:</strong> Mini | <strong>Material:</strong> Soft fleece</p>
        <p>LOOP is a newer brand focused on user comfort. Their mini format and fleece composition minimize irritation, and the simple mint flavour doesn't introduce additional chemical compounds that might aggravate gums.</p>

        <h3>8. White Fox Mint Mini</h3>
        <p><strong>Strength:</strong> 4–5mg | <strong>Format:</strong> Mini | <strong>Material:</strong> Premium fleece</p>
        <p>White Fox uses premium fleece that's exceptionally soft and biocompatible. Their mint mini is one of the gentlest formulations available, with balanced nicotine and minimal pH spike. Ideal for users with severe gum sensitivity.</p>

        <h2>Recommended Products</h2>
        <div class="not-prose grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-8">
          {find('helwit-blueberry-medium') && <BlogProductCard product={find('helwit-blueberry-medium')} />}
